#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_text
#! args    /tmp/figure-overset.input
#! frames  160
#! poster  112
# The example input file shown as text in IBM Plex Mono; a click at the end of the iterations line, Enter opens a new
# line, a cfl entry is typed in the same columns ("(!) modified"), then Save writes the file ("saved")
0   move 400 300
10  move 300 285 15
30  down
32  up
40  key enter
48  text c
51  text f
54  text l         = 0
71  text .
74  text 8
112 move 43 49 15
130 down
132 up
